Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets\nINFO: Repo root:    /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\n\nPASS: A1: manifest parses as YAML\nPASS: A2: schema_version is 1\nPASS: B1: .routes has 31 entries\nPASS: B2: all routes have required keys\nPASS: B3: every route's command names an existing doctor router\nPASS: C1: no duplicate target names within a command\nPASS: D1: all route YAML assets exist\nPASS: E1: all mutation classes valid\nPASS: F2: all route mcp_tools are subsets of their router's allowed-tools union\nPASS: F3: every cli_commands entry invokes the advisor CLI with a known command\nPASS: G1: every route has ≥1 trigger phrase\nPASS: G2: lead_phrases are valid across routes, standalone and mcp_subroutes\nPASS: G3: default_target is boolean, read-only and unique per command\nPASS: I1: all route script_invocations resolve to existing local scripts\nPASS: J1: targets are in parity with their router and presentation across 14 commands\nPASS: K1/K2: no read-only route declares a write or grants a mutating advisor command\nPASS: L1: all 79 route script invocations are invoked by their workflow YAML\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nOK: route-validate — 31 routes validated, 11 warnings\nEXIT=0\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"WARN: H1: flag '--dry-run' appears in multiple /doctor:skill-advisor targets (allowed but informational): tune, rebuild\nWARN: H1: flag '--dry-run' appears in multiple /doctor:git targets (allowed but informational): hooks, standards\nWARN: H1: flag '--profile' appears in multiple /doctor:ci targets (allowed but informational): report, scaffold, toggle\nWARN: H1: flag '--root' appears in multiple /doctor:agents-md targets (allowed but informational): check, embed\nWARN: H1: flag '--dry-run' appears in multiple /doctor:agents-md targets (allowed but informational): embed, restore\nWARN: H1: flag '--root' appears in multiple /doctor:symlink targets (allowed but informational): check, link\nWARN: H1: flag '--runtimes' appears in multiple /doctor:symlink targets (allowed but informational): check, link\nWARN: H1: flag '--include' appears in multiple /doctor:symlink targets (allowed but informational): check, link\nWARN: H1: flag '--link-instructions' appears in multiple /doctor:symlink targets (allowed but informational): check, link\nWARN: H1: flag '--dry-run' appears in multiple /doctor:symlink targets (allowed but informational): link, unlink\nWARN: H1: flag '--root' appears in multiple /doctor:overlay targets (allowed but informational): status, apply, repin\nINFO: Manifest:     /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml\nINFO: Doctor dir:   /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor\nINFO: Assets:       /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets\nINFO: Repo root:    /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\n\nPASS: A1: manifest parses as YAML\nPASS: A2: schema_version is 1\nPASS: B1: .routes has 31 entries\nPASS: B2: all routes have required keys\nPASS: B3: every route's command names an existing doctor router\nPASS: C1: no duplicate target names within a command\nPASS: D1: all route YAML assets exist\nPASS: E1: all mutation classes valid\nPASS: F2: all route mcp_tools are subsets of their router's allowed-tools union\nPASS: F3: every cli_commands entry invokes the advisor CLI with a known command\nPASS: G1: every route has ≥1 trigger phrase\nPASS: G2: lead_phrases are valid across routes, standalone and mcp_subroutes\nPASS: G3: default_target is boolean, read-only and unique per command\nPASS: I1: all route script_invocations resolve to existing local scripts\nPASS: J1: targets are in parity with their router and presentation across 14 commands\nPASS: K1/K2: no read-only route declares a write or grants a mutating advisor command\nPASS: L1: all 79 route script invocations are invoked by their workflow YAML\n\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nOK: route-validate — 31 routes validated, 11 warnings\nEXIT=0\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh 2>&1 | tail -40; echo \\\"EXIT=$?\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794534632698,"end":1794534633849}}}}
