{"type":"text","timestamp":1794534837589,"sessionID":"ses_e2d67e4b3ffe81TsNLL7obW1CH","part":{"id":"prt_1d29c7687002IlHJHANNO7o9NZ","sessionID":"ses_e2d67e4b3ffe81TsNLL7obW1CH","messageID":"msg_1d29c57ed001qD7iKHaQ4Ng1mk","type":"text","text":"**File written**\n- `.skilled/commands/doctor/_routes.yaml` — added the `embedder` route for `/doctor:skill-advisor` directly after `router-reach` (lines 227-245): `target: embedder`, `yaml: doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml`, `setup_vars: [execution_mode, dry_run]`, `allowed_flags: [\"--dry-run\"]`, `mutating: mutates`, a `gate3_location` naming `skill-graph.sqlite` (via `skill_graph_scan`) and the user's Ollama model store, the two T009 advisor CLI commands (`advisor_status --include-semantic-health`, `skill_graph_scan`), `mcp_tools: []`, and six three-plus-word trigger phrases including the three the task names.\n\n**Verify: `bash .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/route-validate.sh`**\n\n```\nEXIT=1\nWARN: H1: flag '--dry-run' appears in multiple /doctor:skill-advisor targets (allowed but informational): tune, rebuild, embedder\n...\nFAIL: J1: target-set parity mismatch — missing from skill-advisor.md targets table: embedder\nFAIL: J1: target-set parity mismatch — missing from skill-advisor presentation menu (Accepted answers): embedder\nFAIL: J1: target-set parity mismatch — missing from skill-advisor presentation 'Valid targets:' line: embedder\nFAIL: J1: target-set parity mismatch — missing from skill-advisor presentation subsystem manifest table: embedder\nFAIL: route-validate — 4 assertion failures, 11 warnings\n\nPASS: A1: manifest parses as YAML\nPASS: A2: schema_version is 1\nPASS: B1: .routes has 32 entries\nPASS: B2: all routes have required keys\nPASS: B3: every route's command names an existing doctor router\nPASS: C1: no duplicate target names within a command\nPASS: D1: all route YAML assets exist\nPASS: E1: all mutation classes valid\nPASS: F2: all route mcp_tools are subsets of their router's allowed-tools u